~ start
if WorldState.has_flag("offering_delivered")
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: The Priestess smiled at the offering. I am... relieved.
	=> END
elif WorldState.has_flag("refused_offering")
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: You really didn't take it. And nothing terrible happened.
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: Yet. Probably. I mean— have a lovely cycle!
	=> END
elif WorldState.has_flag("quest_offering_accepted")
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: The offering! {{Cast.full("priestess")}} is waiting in the Temple.
	=> END
{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: Oh! You're the new arrival. The Festival of the Fourteenth is coming.
{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: Would you carry this offering to {{Cast.full("priestess")}}? Everyone contributes.
{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: Everyone.
- Of course.
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: You're a good one. They notice that, you know.
	do WorldState.set_flag("quest_offering_accepted", true)
- Why does everyone have to contribute?
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: Because... because that's how it's always been?
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: Huh. No one's ever actually asked me that before.
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: Take it anyway — but that was a good question.
	do WorldState.set_flag("questioned_ritual", true)
	do WorldState.set_flag("quest_offering_accepted", true)
- No, thank you.
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: You can... say that? Just like that?
	{{Cast.full("initiate")}}: "No, thank you." Hm. It didn't even thunder.
	do WorldState.set_flag("refused_offering", true)
=> END
